+/*
+   C-like prototype :
+        void j_rev_dct_arm(DCTBLOCK data)
+
+   With DCTBLOCK being a pointer to an array of 64 'signed shorts'
+
+   Copyright (c) 2001 Lionel Ulmer (lionel.ulmer@free.fr / bbrox@bbrox.org)
