@@ -0,0 +1,171 @@
+/*
+ * Floating point AAN IDCT
+ * Copyright (c) 2008 Michael Niedermayer <michaelni@gmx.at>
+ *
+ * This file is part of FFmpeg.
+ *
+ * FFmpeg is free software; you can redistribute it and/or
